<title>MALTA: Malta one-year bill rate rises to 5.3933 percent.</title>
<headline>Malta one-year bill rate rises to 5.3933 percent.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Malta Treasury issued Lm7.0 million ($18.2 million) on Friday of one-year bills maturing on February 13, 1998. The yield rate is 5.3933 percent per year, up from 5.3600 percent in the previous treasury bills issue on November 15, 1996.</p>
</text>
